<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-CAIRO TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-CAIRO TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results on Friday at the Al Ahram international squash tournament (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Paul Johnson (England) 15-6 15-11 15-5</p>
<p>7-Simon Parke (England) beat Amir Wagih (Egypt) 15-8 15-12</p>
<p>15-6 10-Brett Martin (Australia) beat 6-Chris Walker (England) 15-5 17-15 15-8</p>
<p>Alex Waugh (Wales) beat Jonathon Power (Canada) 15-10 5-15 11-2 (Power retired injured).</p>
</text>
